WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.800
Simon Willison is ignoring his ex replies because ai generated slop is wasting everyone's time. This is Models &amp; Agents, Episode 162. Simon Willison called out automated scripts that post pointless questions on ex. Those scripts trick people into spending mental energy on answers nobody cares about. He added that ai slop replies have made him stop reading most of his notifications. Builders should prioritize output quality

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:51.260
and real utility over volume when deploying models in public spaces. The posts underscore a practical problem for anyone building public-facing ai tools. Volume without intent pollutes shared spaces and erodes trust. Watch for similar complaints from other high-profile builders as agent-driven posting increases. Now for the model updates.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:01:19.640
Meme Cult 1000 is a new benchmark with 1000 South Asian memes across Bengali, English, and Hindi. Each meme comes with cultural context notes and human explanations, plus 54 additional Bengali dialogue at memes. 13 vision-language models were tested in meme-only and context-aware settings. Adding minimal cultural context lifted mean SBRET similarity from 44.6 to 56.4.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:32.620
LLM as a judge scores rose from 2.57 to 3.43. Closed source models mainly failed on entity identification while open source models struggled with broader cultural gaps.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:50.240
Vaki Arth introduces the first pragmatic benchmark for Hindi, Punjabi, Tamil, and Malayalam. It covers deixis, speech acts, implicature, social pragmatics, and coherence. Native speaker authored items show consistent model failures on Indic conventions.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:02:00.240
MCQ accuracy exceeds NLI accuracy across families and sizes. Translation performance does not reliably track pragmatic understanding.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:18.360
Indo-Aryan languages show an advantage over Dravidian ones. TalkFast supplies three human-reviewed data sets totaling over 12,000 Farsi dialogues. The data sets cover knowledge-grounded generation, dialogue act annotation, and sentiment-labeled theatrical exchanges.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:27.760
Laura fine-tuning on Lama and Mestral models recovered over 90% of final performance with only 25% to 50% of the training data.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:35.360
Fabbert led dialogue act classification while Laura Mestral 7B performed best on emotion recognition.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:46.240
How output format confounds data quality and capability in instruction tuning, ran gradient signature experiments across 12 tasks and three model families.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:53.840
Output interface rotation leaves spectral statistics invariant while carrying the actual quality signal in the update direction.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:01.680
A skill that raises accuracy more than 40 points under the training format can become nearly invisible under any other interface.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:11.940
Selective knowledge edit reversal via gated singular vector shrinkage locates edit sensitive components inside the dominant singular subspace of edited weights.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:22.180
It reverses only targeted facts while preserving unrelated edits. Experiments confirm that different edits remain separable when the total number of edits stays moderate.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:30.800
Do Cantonese adapted language models better predict Cantonese reading, tested lexical surprise and a joint four metric model.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:43.140
The extensively continued pre-trained Cantonese LLM 7B outperformed its base quint 2.5 to 7B. Entropy reduction favored the lighter CKIP model instead.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:54.420
Now for agent and tool developments. Objection inserts an adversarial lawyer agent into each step of a three-stage offense unlawfulness culpability reasoning pipeline.

00:03:55.020 --> 00:04:06.320
On a new natural innocent data set of 3.4,000 real world cases, the approach cut the false guilty rate from 82.93% to 16.69%.

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:10.160
The pipeline requires no retraining and works at inference time.

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:21.320
High grail roots only graph uncertain candidates from a GNN triage step to an LLM reviewer that receives naturalized multi-hop paths from the knowledge graph.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:31.420
On matte KG, it reached 0.429F1 while cutting LLM calls by 54.36% versus exhaustive review.

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:41.680
Avert combines cross-turn agreement scoring with an audio condition verifier and applies three targeted operators only on slots where each error type is common.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:52.400
On spoken WOZ, it lifted joint goal accuracy from 38.34% to 40.13% without retraining the underlying speech LLM.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:05:06.720
A triagent framework for evaluating and aligning question clarification capabilities uses a question clarifying agent under test, a respondent agent that can give irrelevant or challenging replies, and an evaluator agent.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:14.880
Synthetic supply chain data generation plus native speaker validation provides a repeatable test harness for clarification behavior.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:26.680
NSCopilot orchestrates specialized agents for planning, adaptive control, code generation, and result synthesis while routing to pre-trained models for EEG and spike data.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:35.820
Across eight trials on Alzheimer's, Parkinson's, and working memory benchmarks, it consistently outperforms strong baselines on primary metrics.

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:47.380
Now for practical and community items. ProSTEP trains a generative process reward model that scores both logical validity and evidential grounding at each retrieval reasoning step.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:53.200
It then uses PRM-guided value tree search to build preference pairs for step-level DPO.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:06:02.940
The method achieved the best average EM and F1 across five single and multi-hop QA benchmarks with code, models, and training data released.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:08.000
How do prompt variations affect energy consumption in on-device LLMs?

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:13.220
Separates pre-fill and decode energy across models, devices, and data sets.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:19.060
Cognitive load mainly affects energy per token while phrasing pattern acts through token count.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:26.160
The work supplies phase-level profiling scripts and a public energy quality frontier for model-aware prompt design.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:37.300
Site or decline retrieves only from the active course, uses chapter summaries for transcript ranking, and returns time stamp citations or declines when no evidence matches.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:46.180
In a semester-long deployment, 70.5% of 833 messages included citations and non-crossed course boundaries.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:57.320
Text to QL supplies a seven-stage detection pipeline and pluggable renderers that target both SQL and graph QL from a single query IR representation.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:08.240
The deterministic 0LLM mode delivered 100% execution accuracy at 3.2 milliseconds median latency with no API cost.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:13.560
Schema-aware prompting contributed an 18.4 point exact match gain.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:18.800
Okay, let's pop the hood on dimension-level conditioning in activation steering.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:24.380
Everyone talks about activation steering as if you simply add one vector and the model behaves.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:30.160
In practice, the technique is a set of selectivity decisions that trade precision against overhead.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:36.960
The core move is to decide not only when to steer, but which hidden dimensions actually carry the target concept.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:45.840
GAPS implements this with a static separability gate that keeps only neurons showing reliable concept information via AUROC.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:55.040
A dynamic posterior gate steers a neuron only when its current activation is better explained by the undesired concept under a Gaussian model.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:08:01.620
The two gates add O of D work partoken, yet measurably improved the capability behavior trade-off.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:16.400
On toxicity mitigation with Gemma 3-4B, the combined DSAS plus GAPS pipeline dropped toxicity from 6.52% to 0.48%, while staying inside the same capability budget.

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:19.140
The practical decision rule is straightforward.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:28.820
If your steering vector is dense and you observe capability regression, add dimension-level gating before you increase steering strength or switch to a heavier model.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:36.220
Things to try this week include testing the released pro-step code and models on your own multi-hop rag traces.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:45.780
Run the meme cult 1000 evaluation harness against any vision language model you deploy for South Asian audiences before claiming cultural competence.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:56.360
Add the text to QL deterministic mode to a prototype natural language query interface to measure latency and accuracy gains versus pure LLM routing.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:06.000
Apply the objection lawyer agent pattern to any legal or policy judgment pipeline you maintain and track the drop in false positive guilty labels.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:16.020
Profile your on-device prompts with the energy measurement scripts from the prompt variation study to identify which phrasing patterns cut decode energy most effectively.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:25.440
On the horizon, more labs are expected to release culturally specific pragmatic and meme benchmarks following the Valkyarth and meme cult pattern.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:33.560
Inference time verification layers like Avert and objection will likely appear in commercial agent frameworks within the next quarter.

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:40.380
Energy aware prompt tooling is moving from research scripts to integrated features in on-device SDKs.

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:46.620
Selective edit reversal methods will be packaged as maintenance utilities for long-running fine-tuned models.

